(e) use the Software, or knowledge of its source, to build, train or improve a
    product that competes with the Software;
(f) remove or alter copyright, license or proprietary notices;
(g) circumvent any license check, usage limit or technical protection; or
(h) use the Software outside the covered platforms or after the Term, except as
